{"id":"b3-u03","level":"b3","order":3,"title":{"en":"Rooms and furniture","fr":"Les pièces et les meubles","es":"Habitaciones y muebles","ar":"الغرف والأثاث"},"tip":{"en":"Use 'there is' and 'there are' to say what a room has: 'There is a table in the kitchen.' Words like on, under and next to say where things are.","fr":"Utilisez « il y a » pour dire ce qu'il y a dans une pièce : « Il y a une table dans la cuisine. » Sur, sous et à côté de disent où se trouvent les choses.","es":"Usa «hay» para decir qué hay en una habitación: «Hay una mesa en la cocina». Sobre, debajo de y al lado de dicen dónde están las cosas.","ar":"استعمل «توجد» لتقول ما في الغرفة: «توجد طاولة في المطبخ». وتبين على وتحت وبجانب مكان الأشياء."},"words":36,"lessons":[{"id":"b3-u03-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"house, apartment, room","fr":"maison, appartement, pièce","es":"casa, piso, habitación","ar":"بيت، شقة، غرفة"},"count":11},{"id":"b3-u03-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"kitchen, bathroom, garden","fr":"cuisine, salle de bains, jardin","es":"cocina, baño, jardín","ar":"مطبخ، حمام، حديقة"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u03-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"roof, door, window","fr":"toit, porte, fenêtre","es":"tejado, puerta, ventana","ar":"سقف، باب، نافذة"},"count":11},{"id":"b3-u03-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"table, chair, sofa","fr":"table, chaise, canapé","es":"mesa, silla, sofá","ar":"طاولة، كرسي، أريكة"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u03-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"shelf, lamp, carpet","fr":"étagère, lampe, tapis","es":"estantería, lámpara, alfombra","ar":"رف، مصباح، سجادة"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u03-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"picture, television, refrigerator","fr":"tableau, télévision, frigo","es":"cuadro, televisión, nevera","ar":"لوحة، تلفزيون، ثلاجة"},"count":9},{"id":"b3-u03-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"on, under, inside","fr":"sur, sous, dans","es":"sobre, debajo de, dentro de","ar":"على، تحت، داخل